CCA, endorsed CPAK: verified, 1 anchor, endorser's: true
CCA, key endorsed for another instance: bad signature: no key the CoRIM endorses for the token's instance signed the platform token
CCA, after the CoRIM's not-after: stale: the CoRIM's validity ended before the evidence time
TPM, endorsed AK: appraised
TPM, conditioned key only: refused (tpm_verify_quote_endorsed): the CoRIM endorses no attestation key for instance bbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbb
TPM, no instance named: refused (tpm_verify_quote_endorsed): name the TPM's instance: a quote does not say which TPM made it
reference CoRIM: refused (cca_verify_endorsed): the CoRIM endorses no attestation key for an instance
released and opened: same key
